#: ../caribou/antler/antler_settings.py:11
msgid ""
"The keyboard geometry determines the shape and complexity of the keyboard, "
"it could range from a 'natural' look and feel good for composing simple "
"text, to a fullscale keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Die sleutelbordgeometrie bepaal die vorm en kompleksiteit van die "
"sleutelbord, dit kan wissel van 'n 'natuurlike' voorkoms en voel goed vir "
"die samestelling van eenvoudige teks, tot 'n volskaalse sleutelbord."

